&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 16px"&gt;研修時間&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 148px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 16px"&gt;前年実績（9.34時間）を&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 16px"&gt;上回る研修時間&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 148px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 16px"&gt;10.45時間&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; width: 148px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 16px"&gt;2023年度実績を&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 16px"&gt;上回る研修時間&lt;/p&gt;
